{"id":"e59beb3704642c3f","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint.md","title":"thm-dependent-quantifier-adjunction","display":"thm-dependent-quantifier-adjunction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint","aliases":["16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint","Dependent quantifier adjunction","16-dep-quantifier-adjoint"],"display":"thm-dependent-quantifier-adjunction","depends_on":["[[16-df-dep-exists]]","[[16-df-dep-forall]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]"],"source":"Definition 9.3.5(i) pp.540–541 (PDF560–561); Definition 10.5.1 p.624 (PDF644)","revision_date":"2026-10-16","verification_status":"proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint</span><span>Dependent quantifier adjunction</span><span>16-dep-quantifier-adjoint</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dependent-quantifier-adjunction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3ae97efa23f80edf\" href=\"?note=3ae97efa23f80edf\" title=\"16-df-dep-exists\">16-df-dep-exists</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"035ab4b3b2445fb6\" href=\"?note=035ab4b3b2445fb6\" title=\"16-df-dep-forall\">16-df-dep-forall</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 9.3.5(i) pp.540–541 (PDF560–561); Definition 10.5.1 p.624 (PDF644)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p,\\chi)\">\\((p,\\chi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ae97efa23f80edf\" href=\"?note=3ae97efa23f80edf\" title=\"16-df-dep-exists\">16-df-dep-exists</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"035ab4b3b2445fb6\" href=\"?note=035ab4b3b2445fb6\" title=\"16-df-dep-forall\">16-df-dep-forall</a> 的同基底结构。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasDepForall}(q,D_\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{HasDepForall}(q,D_\\chi)\\)</span>，取各定义同一见证中的伴随族。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:A\\to I\\in D_\\chi\">\\(d:A\\to I\\in D_\\chi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_d,\\Pi_d:\\mathcal P_A\\to\\mathcal P_I\">\\(\\Sigma_d,\\Pi_d:\\mathcal P_A\\to\\mathcal P_I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d^*:\\mathcal P_I\\to\\mathcal P_A\">\\(d^*:\\mathcal P_I\\to\\mathcal P_A\\)</span>。取所选伴随的自然 Hom 双射数据 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi,\\Psi\">\\(\\Phi,\\Psi\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjHom}\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjHom}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibPre}(q)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibPre}(q)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a>。下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_J\">\\(\\le_J\\)</span> 是本页定义的纤维箭头存在关系；只有在附加预序纤维条件下才把它作为命题逻辑的序解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\Sigma_d\\dashv d^*\\dashv\\Pi_d,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_d,d^*,\\Phi)\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(d^*,\\Pi_d,\\Psi),\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_A)(\\forall Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_I)\\Bigl[\n\\Phi_{P,Q}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_I}(\\Sigma_dP,Q)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_A}(P,d^*Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\Psi_{Q,P}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_A}(d^*Q,P)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_I}(Q,\\Pi_dP)\\Bigr],\\\\\n&amp;P\\le_JQ\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_J}(P,Q)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\quad(J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B,\\ P,Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_J),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{FibPre}(q)\\Longrightarrow\n(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_A)(\\forall Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_I)\\Bigl[\n(\\Sigma_dP\\le_IQ\\Longleftrightarrow P\\le_Ad^*Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(d^*Q\\le_AP\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\le_I\\Pi_dP)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\Sigma_d\\dashv d^*\\dashv\\Pi_d,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_d,d^*,\\Phi)\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(d^*,\\Pi_d,\\Psi),\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_A)(\\forall Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_I)\\Bigl[\n\\Phi_{P,Q}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_I}(\\Sigma_dP,Q)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_A}(P,d^*Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\Psi_{Q,P}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_A}(d^*Q,P)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_I}(Q,\\Pi_dP)\\Bigr],\\\\\n&amp;P\\le_JQ\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_J}(P,Q)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\quad(J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B,\\ P,Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_J),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{FibPre}(q)\\Longrightarrow\n(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_A)(\\forall Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_I)\\Bigl[\n(\\Sigma_dP\\le_IQ\\Longleftrightarrow P\\le_Ad^*Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(d^*Q\\le_AP\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\le_I\\Pi_dP)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>伴随族的定义给出前两行；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjHom}\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjHom}\\)</span> 的自然性公理保证两族双射同时对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span> 自然。预序纤维中 Hom 集至多单元素，因此相应 Hom 双射等价于两个箭头存在条件，得到最后一行。这不是把任意类型集合自动变成命题偏序。</p>\n<p>原稿的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma\\)</span> 对任意码集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 没有依赖和、依赖积闭包，也没有给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span>。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\{\\{0,1\\}\\}\">\\(U=\\{\\{0,1\\}\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=\\{*\\}\">\\(\\Gamma=\\{*\\}\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(*)=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\sigma(*)=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(*,a)=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\tau(*,a)=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；标准依赖和、依赖积的值均有四个元素，不能仍作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 中唯一二元素集合的类型码。本页恢复实际纤维范畴及显式伴随假设，不在该任意码集上断言闭包。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasDepExists}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasDepExists}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasDepForall}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasDepForall}\\)</span> 只提供最小伴随存在性；完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span>-products/coproducts 另要求 BC。特别不能由这条伴随链单独推出任意换基下的量词替换律。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dep-exists","status":"resolved","id":"3ae97efa23f80edf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dep-exists]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dep-forall","status":"resolved","id":"035ab4b3b2445fb6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dep-forall]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dep-exists","status":"resolved","id":"3ae97efa23f80edf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(p,\\chi)$、$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$、$D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-dep-exists]]、[[16-df-dep-forall]] 的同基底结构。假设 $\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)$ 与 $\\mathrm{HasDepForall}(q,D_\\chi)$，取各定义同一见证中的伴随族。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dep-forall","status":"resolved","id":"035ab4b3b2445fb6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(p,\\chi)$、$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$、$D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-dep-exists]]、[[16-df-dep-forall]] 的同基底结构。假设 $\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)$ 与 $\\mathrm{HasDepForall}(q,D_\\chi)$，取各定义同一见证中的伴随族。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$d:A\\to I\\in D_\\chi$，$\\Sigma_d,\\Pi_d:\\mathcal P_A\\to\\mathcal P_I$，$d^*:\\mathcal P_I\\to\\mathcal P_A$。取所选伴随的自然 Hom 双射数据 $\\Phi,\\Psi$；$\\mathrm{AdjHom}$ 采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibPre}(q)$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]]。下文 $\\le_J$ 是本页定义的纤维箭头存在关系；只有在附加预序纤维条件下才把它作为命题逻辑的序解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasDepForall}(q,D_\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"d:A\\to I\\in D_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_d,\\Pi_d:\\mathcal P_A\\to\\mathcal P_I","display":false},{"tex":"d^*:\\mathcal P_I\\to\\mathcal P_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi,\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdjHom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibPre}(q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\Sigma_d\\dashv d^*\\dashv\\Pi_d,\\\\\n&\\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_d,d^*,\\Phi)\\land\\mathrm{AdjHom}(d^*,\\Pi_d,\\Psi),\\\\\n&(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_A)(\\forall Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_I)\\Bigl[\n\\Phi_{P,Q}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_I}(\\Sigma_dP,Q)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_A}(P,d^*Q)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\Psi_{Q,P}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_A}(d^*Q,P)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_I}(Q,\\Pi_dP)\\Bigr],\\\\\n&P\\le_JQ\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P_J}(P,Q)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\quad(J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B,\\ P,Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_J),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{FibPre}(q)\\Longrightarrow\n(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_A)(\\forall Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal P_I)\\Bigl[\n(\\Sigma_dP\\le_IQ\\Longleftrightarrow P\\le_Ad^*Q)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(d^*Q\\le_AP\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\le_I\\Pi_dP)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdjHom}","display":false},{"tex":"P,Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\le","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\{\\{0,1\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=\\{*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(*)=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(*,a)=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasDepExists}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasDepForall}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false}],"bytes":3167,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-display-map-category]]、[[16-df-relatively-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-dependent-product]]、[[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint]]、[[16-df-power-object]]、[[16-df-singleton-map]]、[[16-lem-singleton-monic]]、[[16-thm-power-object]]。最小伴随存在性与完整含BC的理解积分别保留；singleton单态性用任意广义元素证明。"},{"id":"1234291ff963e08e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$(p,\\chi)$、$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$、$D_\\chi$ 与所选伴随族满足 [[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint]] 的全部假设。$\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$、$\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Gamma$，$\\pi_{\\sigma}:\\{\\sigma\\}\\to\\Gamma$ 为同一 $\\chi$ 的理解投影，$\\pi_{\\sigma}\\in D_\\chi$。"},{"id":"1be67ddbd558c3ce","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$(p,\\chi)$、$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$、$D_\\chi$ 与所选伴随族满足 [[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint]] 的全部假设。$\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$、$A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Gamma$，$\\pi_{A}:\\{A\\}\\to\\Gamma$ 为同一 $\\chi$ 的理解投影，$\\pi_{A}\\in D_\\chi$。"}],"outgoing":["3ae97efa23f80edf","035ab4b3b2445fb6","a88937ea87ff8530","ddfda06bbcc2ec7b"]}